// panic-crashes.test.maxon — CRASHED: a test that takes the process down, and the test after it being
// re-run in a fresh process rather than called green or lost.
//
// One spawning `test` per file — `fixtures.test.maxon`'s header owns why.

test 'panic-crashes reports CRASHED and re-runs the test that never got to run'
	try checkFixture("panic-crashes")
end 'panic-crashes reports CRASHED and re-runs the test that never got to run'
